NOTICE — game-derived code

This mod patches Surviving Mars: Relaunched (Haemimont Games / Paradox
Interactive) at runtime. To keep fixes minimal and reviewable, some files
under Code/ contain excerpts or modified copies of the game's shipped Lua
source (lines not marked "-- FIX" in full-replacement fixes). Those portions
remain the copyright of Haemimont Games / Paradox Interactive and are included
solely to repair defects, as permitted for mods built with the game's shipped
ModTools. The MIT license above applies only to the original portions of this
project.
